:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Atmosphere [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-casino-atmosphere'>>
<<nobr>>
	<<if Time.hour gte 3 and Time.hour lt 4>>
		<<language>>
			<<option 'EN'>>
				A server collects the empty glasses. The cashier puts a lid on a tray of chips, then waits while a guest searches every pocket for one last counter. <span class='blue'>There is little time left before closing.</span>
			<<option 'CN'>>
				服务员收走空酒杯。收银员盖上一盘筹码，又停下来，等一名客人把所有口袋翻遍，找出最后一枚。<span class='blue'>离关门已经没多久了。</span>
		<</language>>
	<<elseif _casino.state.suspicion gte 60>>
		<<language>>
			<<option 'EN'>>
				A bouncer stops beside your table. The players keep betting, but <span class='purple'>the bouncer's eyes follow your hands</span> rather than the cards.
			<<option 'CN'>>
				一名保安停在你的牌桌旁。客人们仍在下注，但<span class='purple'>保安盯着的是你的手</span>，而不是桌上的牌。
		<</language>>
	<<else>>
		<<switch _casino.state.atmosphere>>
			<<case 0>>
				<<language>>
					<<option 'EN'>>
						A guest feeds a chip into the slot machine and leans forward as the reels stop, one after another. Nothing falls into the tray. The guest searches a pocket, finds another chip, and tries again.
					<<option 'CN'>>
						一名客人往老虎机里投入筹码，探着身子，盯住依次停下的转轮。托盘里没有落下任何东西。客人摸了摸口袋，找到另一枚筹码，又投了进去。
					<</language>>
			<<case 1>>
				<<language>>
					<<option 'EN'>>
						The slot machine rings. A guest laughs as <span class='gold'>chips clatter into the tray</span>, then cups both hands beneath it. Someone watching from behind asks for a turn. The winner sits down again instead.
					<<option 'CN'>>
						老虎机响起铃声。<span class='gold'>筹码哗啦啦地落进托盘</span>，客人笑着把双手捧在下面。身后围观的人问能不能换自己试试。赢家却又坐了回去。
				<</language>>
			<<case 2>>
				<<language>>
					<<option 'EN'>>
						Two guests share the chair by the slot machine. One presses the button while the other whispers into their ear, <span class='purple'>a hand slipping beneath the hem of their jacket</span>. The reels stop. Neither seems to notice.
					<<option 'CN'>>
						两名客人挤在老虎机前的一张椅子上。一人按下按钮，另一人凑在耳边低语，<span class='purple'>手探进了对方的外套下摆</span>。转轮停了下来，两人似乎都没注意到。
				<</language>>
			<<case 3>>
				<<language>>
					<<option 'EN'>>
						A player slaps a losing hand onto the table. "Again." The dealer waits until the player takes their drink off the cloth, then gathers the cards without a word.
					<<option 'CN'>>
						一名客人把输掉的牌拍在桌上。“再来。”荷官等对方把酒杯挪出桌布，才一言不发地收起牌。
				<</language>>
			<<case 4>>
				<<language>>
					<<option 'EN'>>
						In a corner, a guest bends over a small mirror and inhales <span class='purple'>a line of white powder</span> through a rolled note. Their companion puts the mirror away as a server approaches. The server leaves two drinks and keeps walking.
					<<option 'CN'>>
						角落里，一名客人俯在小镜子上，用卷起的纸钞吸走<span class='purple'>一道白色粉末</span>。服务员走近时，同伴收起了镜子。服务员放下两杯酒，继续往前走。
				<</language>>
			<<case 5>>
				<<language>>
					<<option 'EN'>>
						A guest swallows something small with a mouthful of liquor. Beneath the table, their knee keeps bouncing. The person beside them offers a glass of water; it remains untouched.
					<<option 'CN'>>
						一名客人就着烈酒吞下了什么小东西。桌子下面，对方的膝盖不停抖动。同伴递来一杯水，杯子却一直没人碰。
				<</language>>
			<<case 6>>
				<<language>>
					<<option 'EN'>>
						A guest hooks a finger into a server's waistband. The server catches the wrist and moves it away. A bouncer takes one step towards the table. <span class='purple'>The guest lets go.</span>
					<<option 'CN'>>
						一名客人用手指勾住服务员的腰带。服务员攥住对方的手腕，把手移开。保安朝牌桌迈了一步。<span class='purple'>客人松了手。</span>
				<</language>>
			<<case 7>>
				<<language>>
					<<option 'EN'>>
						The cashier counts out a guest's chips twice. "That's all of them." The guest stares at the small pile of notes, then at the tables. After a pause, they take the money and head for the stairs.
					<<option 'CN'>>
						收银员把一名客人的筹码数了两遍。“全在这里了。”客人盯着那一小沓纸钞，又看看牌桌。过了一会儿，对方拿起钱，走向楼梯。
				<</language>>
			<<case 8>>
				<<language>>
					<<option 'EN'>>
						A guest lifts a stack of chips to tip a server. "Stay a minute?" The server glances at the occupied tables, takes one chip, and promises to return with another drink.
					<<option 'CN'>>
						一名客人举起一叠筹码，想给服务员小费。“陪我坐一会儿？”服务员看了看还有人的牌桌，拿走一枚筹码，答应再送一杯酒来。
				<</language>>
			<<default>>
				<<language>>
					<<option 'EN'>>
						A pair of spectators count along as a player reveals three cards. One swears under their breath and passes the other a banknote. At the table, the winner is already choosing the next bet.
					<<option 'CN'>>
						两名围观的客人跟着数出翻开的三张牌。一人低声骂了一句，递给另一人一张纸钞。牌桌上的赢家已经开始准备下一次下注。
				<</language>>
		<</switch>>
	<</if>><br><br>
<</nobr>>
<</widget>>
